Exact statements extracted (line numbers in that text):
* Def 1.1 (p.112): arithmetic line bundle L=(L,|-|_L) on normal proper flat X/Z,
  conjugation-compatible hermitian metric; APic(X).
* Def 1.2 (p.213): height function ht_M; BD-class relations <~, >~, ~; BD-class [alpha].
* Example 1.3 (p.231): X(Q)<=d, X(Q)=d, Galois-finite subsets; compactly bounded
