* Prop 1.4 (p.294): (i) ht_{L tensor M} = ht_L + ht_M; (ii) generated by sections =>
  ht_L >~ 0; (iii) BD-class depends only on L_Q; (iv) finiteness of bounded-height
  points in X(Q)<=d for ample L_Q.
* Def 1.5 (p.432): minimal field of definition; reduced divisor; log-different;
  conductor f^D_x and log-cond_D.
* Prop 1.6 (p.505): log-cond_D <~ ht_D on U(Q).
* Prop 1.7 (p.524): log-cond_E - log-cond_D <~ log-diff_Y - log-diff_Z <~
  (1 - 1/e) log-cond_E on U_Y(Q)<=d.
* Thm 2.1 (p.615): EQUIVALENCE of (i) Effective Mordell/ABC/Vojta (ht_omega_X(D) <~
