  compactly bounded subsets on P^1 with C={0,1,inf}.

ROLE: [GenEll] Thm 2.1 is the proved REDUCTION THEOREM (compactly bounded =>
general); it is NOT a proof of ABC and NOT the IUT-side estimate. The IUT-side
